/-!
# Binary Goldbach up to `2·10¹²` (verified computation)

The 200 chunks `binary_chunk_j` (files `BinaryChunks/B*.lean`, built in parallel) each check
`goldbachChunk 9999 (6 + j * 10000000000) 500000 10000 = true` by `native_decide`.
-/

namespace Goldbach.Check

theorem binary_chunks_ok : ∀ j < 200, goldbachChunk 9999 (6 + j * 10000000000) 500000 10000 = true := by
